Rough code to reproduce:

```
    LocalAddress address = new LocalAddress("test");
    LocalEventLoopGroup group = new LocalEventLoopGroup(1);
    {
        ServerBootstrap b = new ServerBootstrap()
                .group(group)
                .channel(LocalServerChannel.class)
                .childHandler(new ChannelClosingHandler() { channelRead(...) : ctx.close() });
        b.bind(address).sync();
    }

    Bootstrap b = new Bootstrap()
            .group(group)
            .channel(LocalChannel.class)
            .handler(new EmptyHandler());
    Channel channel = b.connect(address).sync().channel();
    channel.write(anything);
```

Change the 1 to a 2 to make it not crash.

Please excuse me not including the exact handlers, but there's nothing extra in them.
